    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Praise to the Creator"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rejoice in the Lord, you righteous ones;",
          "praise from the upright is beautiful."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Praise the Lord with the lyre;",
          "make music to him with a ten-stringed harp."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing a new song to him;",
          "play skillfully on the strings, with a joyful shout."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the word of the Lord is right,",
          "and all his work is trustworthy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He loves righteousness and justice;",
          "the earth is full of the Lord’s unfailing love."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The heavens were made by the word of the Lord,",
          "and all the stars, by the breath of his mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gathers the water of the sea into a heap;",
          "he puts the depths into storehouses."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let the whole earth fear the Lord;",
          "let all the inhabitants of the world stand in awe of him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he spoke, and it came into being;",
          "he commanded, and it came into existence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord frustrates the counsel of the nations;",
          "he thwarts the plans of the peoples."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The counsel of the Lord stands forever,",
          "the plans of his heart from generation to generation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Happy is the nation whose God is the Lord —",
          "the people he has chosen to be his own possession!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord looks down from heaven;",
          "he observes everyone."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gazes on all the inhabitants of the earth",
          "from his dwelling place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He forms the hearts of them all;",
          "he considers all their works."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A king is not saved by a large army;",
          "a warrior will not be rescued by great strength."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The horse is a false hope for safety;",
          "it provides no escape by its great power."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But look, the Lord keeps his eye on those who fear him —",
          "those who depend on his faithful love"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "to rescue them from death",
          "and to keep them alive in famine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We wait for the Lord;",
          "he is our help and shield."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For our hearts rejoice in him",
          "because we trust in his holy name."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May your faithful love rest on us, Lord,",
          "for we put our hope in you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
